msgstr "standard"

#: includes/admin.php:380
msgid "Premium is in your plan but paused: this month's minutes are used up, so calls use the standard voice until next month."
msgstr "La voix premium est incluse dans votre formule mais en pause : les minutes de ce mois sont épuisées, les appels utilisent donc la voix standard jusqu’au mois prochain."

#: includes/admin.php:384
msgid "Add to cart from the chat"
msgstr "Ajout au panier depuis le chat"

#: includes/admin.php:384
msgid "available"
msgstr "disponible"

#: includes/admin.php:384
msgid "not available"
msgstr "indisponible"

#: includes/admin.php:385
msgid "The server did not recognise this store as WooCommerce. Reconnect to fix it."
msgstr "Le serveur n’a pas reconnu cette boutique comme une boutique WooCommerce. Reconnectez-la pour corriger."

#: includes/admin.php:388
#: includes/admin.php:883
#: includes/admin.php:884
msgid "Light or dark"
msgstr "Clair ou sombre"

#: includes/admin.php:389
msgid "follows the shopper's device"
msgstr "suit l’appareil du client"

#: includes/admin.php:389
msgid "always dark"
msgstr "toujours sombre"

#: includes/admin.php:389
msgid "always light"
msgstr "toujours clair"

#: includes/admin.php:393
#: includes/admin.php:939
msgid "Greeting bubble"
msgstr "Bulle d’accueil"

#. translators: %d: the delay in seconds before the greeting appears
#: includes/admin.php:395
#, php-format
msgid "after %ds"
msgstr "après %d s"

#: includes/admin.php:397
msgid "Greeting customers by name"
msgstr "Accueil des clients par leur prénom"

#: includes/admin.php:404
msgid "Storefront check"
msgstr "Vérification de la boutique"

#: includes/admin.php:405
msgid "What the chat on your shop is running right now"
msgstr "Ce que le chat de votre boutique utilise en ce moment"

#. translators: %d: how many things still need fixing
#: includes/admin.php:410
#, php-format
msgid "%d thing to fix"
msgid_plural "%d things to fix"
msgstr[0] "%d point à corriger"
msgstr[1] "%d points à corriger"

#: includes/admin.php:411
msgid "All good"
msgstr "Tout est en ordre"

#. translators: %s: widget script URL
#: includes/admin.php:419
#, php-format
msgid "Your pages load the chat from %s. After changing anything, reload your shop with a hard refresh."
msgstr "Vos pages chargent le chat depuis %s. Après une modification, rechargez votre boutique en forçant l’actualisation."

#: includes/admin.php:435
msgid "Connect your shop"
msgstr "Connecter votre boutique"

#: includes/admin.php:436
#: includes/admin.php:966
msgid "Let shoppers call the assistant"
msgstr "Permettre aux clients d’appeler l’assistant"

#: includes/admin.php:436
msgid "Shoppers who call ask more and buy more."
msgstr "Les clients qui appellent posent plus de questions et achètent davantage."

#: includes/admin.php:437
msgid "Turn on the greeting bubble"
msgstr "Activer la bulle d’accueil"

#: includes/admin.php:437
msgid "Most shoppers never open a chat nobody offered."
msgstr "La plupart des clients n’ouvrent jamais un chat que personne ne leur propose."

#: includes/admin.php:438
msgid "Add your policy notes"
msgstr "Ajouter vos conditions"

#: includes/admin.php:438
msgid "Without them it says \"I don't know\" to the most common questions."
msgstr "Sans eux, il répond « je ne sais pas » aux questions les plus fréquentes."

#: includes/admin.php:439
msgid "Say when your team replies"
msgstr "Indiquer quand votre équipe répond"

#: includes/admin.php:439
msgid "So a handoff tells the shopper when to expect an answer."
msgstr "Pour qu’un transfert dise au client quand attendre une réponse."

#: includes/admin.php:440
msgid "Put it in your colours"
msgstr "Lui donner vos couleurs"

#: includes/admin.php:440
msgid "It should look like part of your shop."
msgstr "Il doit avoir l’air de faire partie de votre boutique."

#: includes/admin.php:450
msgid "Finish setting up"
msgstr "Terminer la configuration"

#: includes/admin.php:451
msgid "A few minutes each. This card goes away once everything is done."
msgstr "Quelques minutes chacune. Cette carte disparaît une fois tout terminé."

#. translators: 1: steps done, 2: steps in total
#: includes/admin.php:454
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d of %2$d done"
msgstr "%1$d sur %2$d terminées"

#: includes/admin.php:466
msgid "Done"
msgstr "Fait"

#: includes/admin.php:468
msgid "Do it"
msgstr "Le faire"

#: includes/admin.php:482
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "Bienvenue"

#: includes/admin.php:483
msgid "Connect your store to meet your sales assistant"
msgstr "Connectez votre boutique pour découvrir votre assistant de vente"

#: includes/admin.php:484
msgid "Two minutes: create your Parla account (the first 14 days are free, no card), copy the shop key it shows you, paste it here. Once connected, this page shows the sales it helps with, what shoppers ask for, and what they could not find."
msgstr "Deux minutes : créez votre compte Parla (les 14 premiers jours sont gratuits, sans carte bancaire), copiez la clé de boutique qu’il vous montre, collez-la ici. Une fois la boutique connectée, cette page affiche les ventes auxquelles il contribue, ce que demandent les clients et ce qu’ils n’ont pas trouvé."

#: includes/admin.php:486
msgid "Create your free account"
msgstr "Créer mon compte gratuit"

#: includes/admin.php:487
msgid "I have my shop key"
msgstr "J’ai déjà ma clé de boutique"

#: includes/admin.php:488
msgid "See it on a demo shop first"
msgstr "Le voir d’abord sur une boutique de démonstration"

#: includes/admin.php:1061
msgid "No account yet?"
msgstr "Pas encore de compte ?"

#: includes/admin.php:1061
msgid "The first 14 days are free, with no card. The key for this shop is shown as soon as the account exists."
msgstr "Les 14 premiers jours sont gratuits, sans carte bancaire. La clé de cette boutique s’affiche dès que le compte existe."

#: includes/admin.php:1065
msgid "Create your free Parla account"
msgstr "Créer mon compte Parla gratuit"

#: includes/admin.php:500
msgid "How it is going"
msgstr "Où en est votre assistant"

#: includes/admin.php:501
msgid "Everything here is about your shop only."
msgstr "Tout ce qui figure ici concerne uniquement votre boutique."

#: includes/admin.php:504
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Actualiser"

#. translators: %s: the reason the figures could not be loaded
#: includes/admin.php:515
#, php-format
msgid "The conversation numbers are not available right now (%s). Sales above come from your own orders and are always up to date."
msgstr "Les chiffres des conversations ne sont pas disponibles pour le moment (%s). Les ventes ci-dessus viennent de vos propres commandes et sont toujours à jour."

#: includes/admin.php:531
msgid "Messages"
msgstr "Messages"

#. translators: 1: conversations today, 2: conversations this week
#: includes/admin.php:534
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s today, %2$s this week"
msgstr "%1$s aujourd’hui, %2$s cette semaine"

#: includes/admin.php:538
msgid "Found it helpful"
msgstr "Réponses jugées utiles"

#. translators: %d: how many shoppers rated an answer
#: includes/admin.php:541
#, php-format
msgid "from %d rating"
msgid_plural "from %d ratings"
msgstr[0] "sur %d note"
msgstr[1] "sur %d notes"

#. translators: %d: how many shoppers rated an answer
#: includes/admin.php:541
msgid "shows after 5 ratings"
msgstr "s’affiche après 5 notes"

#: includes/admin.php:543
msgid "Handed to your team"
msgstr "Transmis à votre équipe"

#: includes/admin.php:543
msgid "conversations that needed a person"
msgstr "conversations qui ont demandé une personne"

#: includes/admin.php:546
#: includes/admin.php:652
msgid "Waiting for a restock"
msgstr "En attente de réassort"

#: includes/admin.php:546
msgid "emailed when it is back"
msgstr "prévenus par e-mail au retour en stock"

#: includes/admin.php:547
msgid "Asked for, not sold"
msgstr "Demandé, non vendu"

#: includes/admin.php:547
msgid "people waiting to hear"
msgstr "personnes en attente de nouvelles"

#: includes/admin.php:554
msgid "Premium call minutes"
msgstr "Minutes d’appel premium"

#. translators: %d: how many premium voice calls this month
#: includes/admin.php:557
#, php-format
msgid "%d call this month"
msgid_plural "%d calls this month"
msgstr[0] "%d appel ce mois-ci"
msgstr[1] "%d appels ce mois-ci"

#: includes/admin.php:567
msgid "Asked for, and waiting to hear"
msgstr "Demandé, en attente de nouvelles"

#: includes/admin.php:568
msgid "You do not sell these yet. Add a matching product and everyone on the list gets one email from your shop, automatically."
msgstr "Vous ne vendez pas encore ces articles. Ajoutez un produit correspondant et chaque personne de la liste reçoit automatiquement un e-mail de votre boutique."

#. translators: %d: how many shoppers are waiting for this product
#: includes/admin.php:575
#, php-format
msgid "%d person"
msgid_plural "%d people"
msgstr[0] "%d personne"
msgstr[1] "%d personnes"

#: includes/admin.php:592
msgid "Searches that found nothing"
msgstr "Recherches sans résultat"

#: includes/admin.php:592
msgid "Your restocking list"
msgstr "Votre liste de réassort"

#: includes/admin.php:593
msgid "Questions your pages did not answer"
msgstr "Questions sans réponse sur vos pages"

#: includes/admin.php:593
msgid "Each is a paragraph worth writing"
msgstr "Chacune mérite un paragraphe"

#: includes/admin.php:594
msgid "Answers marked unhelpful"
msgstr "Réponses jugées inutiles"

#: includes/admin.php:594
msgid "Usually one missing line of policy"
msgstr "Souvent une ligne qui manque dans vos conditions"

#: includes/admin.php:599
msgid "What shoppers asked for"
msgstr "Ce que les clients ont demandé"

#: includes/admin.php:600
msgid "Last 30 days. The details are on the Reports tab."
msgstr "30 derniers jours. Le détail est dans l’onglet Rapports."

#: includes/admin.php:624
msgid "Nothing to report yet. Come back once shoppers have used the chat."
msgstr "Rien à signaler pour l’instant. Revenez quand des clients auront utilisé le chat."

#: includes/admin.php:631
msgid "Looked for, not found"
msgstr "Cherché, pas trouvé"

#: includes/admin.php:632
msgid "Searches with no result in the last 30 days. Your restocking list."
msgstr "Recherches sans résultat ces 30 derniers jours. Votre liste de réassort."

#: includes/admin.php:634
msgid "Nothing yet. Every search found something."
msgstr "Rien pour l’instant. Chaque recherche a trouvé quelque chose."

#: includes/admin.php:638
msgid "Asked, but your pages do not say"
msgstr "Demandé, mais vos pages n’en disent rien"

#: includes/admin.php:639
msgid "Questions your published pages had no answer for. Each is a paragraph worth writing."
msgstr "Les questions auxquelles vos pages publiées ne répondaient pas. Chacune mérite un paragraphe."

#: includes/admin.php:641
msgid "Nothing yet. Your pages covered every question."
msgstr "Rien pour l’instant. Vos pages ont répondu à toutes les questions."

#: includes/admin.php:648
msgid "Removed from the list."
msgstr "Retiré de la liste."

#: includes/admin.php:653
msgid "They asked to be told when a sold-out size or colour is back. The email leaves from your shop, once, and the address is deleted with it."
msgstr "Ils ont demandé à être prévenus du retour d’une taille ou d’une couleur épuisée. L’e-mail part de votre boutique, une seule fois, et l’adresse est supprimée au même moment."

#: includes/admin.php:654
msgid "Nobody is waiting on a restock right now."
msgstr "Personne n’attend de réassort pour le moment."

#: includes/admin.php:658
msgid "Asked for something you do not sell"
msgstr "Ont demandé un article que vous ne vendez pas"

#: includes/admin.php:659
msgid "They agreed to hear from you if it ever arrives. Nothing was promised: the assistant only ever says it will get in touch."
msgstr "Ils ont accepté d’avoir de vos nouvelles si l’article arrive un jour. Rien n’a été promis : l’assistant dit seulement que vous reprendrez contact."

#: includes/admin.php:660
msgid "Nobody is waiting on something you do not carry."
msgstr "Personne n’attend un article que vous ne proposez pas."

#: includes/admin.php:667
msgid "Answers shoppers marked unhelpful"
msgstr "Réponses jugées inutiles par les clients"

#: includes/admin.php:668
msgid "Most are fixed by adding a line to the policy notes or the sizing advice."
msgstr "La plupart se règlent en ajoutant une ligne à vos conditions ou aux conseils de taille."

#. translators: 1: how many are listed, 2: how many there were in total
#: includes/admin.php:679
#, php-format
msgid "The %1$s most recent, of %2$s marked unhelpful in 30 days"
msgstr "Les %1$s plus récentes, sur %2$s jugées inutiles en 30 jours"

#: includes/admin.php:690
msgid "They asked"
msgstr "Question"

#: includes/admin.php:691
msgid "It answered"
msgstr "Réponse"

#: includes/admin.php:692
msgid "When"
msgstr "Quand"

#. translators: %s: how many are listed
#: includes/admin.php:723
#, php-format
msgid "The %s most recent are listed. Fix a few and the rest will thin out on their own."
msgstr "Les %s plus récentes sont affichées. Corrigez-en quelques-unes et les autres se raréfieront d’elles-mêmes."

#: includes/admin.php:736
msgid "What it may tell shoppers"
msgstr "Ce qu’il peut dire aux clients"

#: includes/admin.php:736
msgid "The assistant only repeats facts you give it here or on your published pages. It never guesses a policy."
msgstr "L’assistant ne répète que les informations que vous lui donnez ici ou sur vos pages publiées. Il ne devine jamais une condition."

#: includes/admin.php:737
msgid "Return window"
msgstr "Délai de retour"

#: includes/admin.php:737
msgid "Days after delivery a shopper can send something back."
msgstr "Nombre de jours après la livraison pendant lesquels un client peut renvoyer un article."

#: includes/admin.php:741
msgid "days"
msgstr "jours"

#: includes/admin.php:744
msgid "Policy notes"
msgstr "Vos conditions"

#: includes/admin.php:744
msgid "Short facts it may share: shipping times, free returns, final-sale rules."
msgstr "Des informations courtes qu’il peut donner : délais de livraison, retours gratuits, articles non repris."

#: includes/admin.php:747
msgid "Free returns in store. Final-sale items cannot be returned. Delivery in 2 to 4 working days."
msgstr "Retours gratuits en magasin. Les articles soldés ne sont pas repris. Livraison en 2 à 4 jours ouvrés."

#: includes/admin.php:751
msgid "Sizes and measurements"
msgstr "Tailles et dimensions"

#: includes/admin.php:751
msgid "Only if what you sell comes in sizes or has to fit somewhere: clothes, shoes, rings, furniture. Without it, it never guesses a size or a measurement."
msgstr "Seulement si vos articles ont une taille ou doivent trouver leur place : vêtements, chaussures, bagues, meubles. Sans ces informations, il ne devine jamais une taille ni une mesure."

#: includes/admin.php:754
msgid "Runs small, size up if you are between sizes. Chest: S 96cm, M 102cm, L 108cm."
msgstr "Taille petit, prenez la taille au-dessus si vous hésitez. Tour de poitrine : S 96 cm, M 102 cm, L 108 cm."

#: includes/admin.php:760
msgid "Orders"
msgstr "Commandes"

#: includes/admin.php:760
msgid "How the assistant reads your order statuses."
msgstr "Comment l’assistant lit les statuts de vos commandes."

#: includes/admin.php:761
#: includes/admin.php:765
msgid "\"Completed\" means"
msgstr "« Terminée » signifie"

#: includes/admin.php:761
msgid "WooCommerce has no delivered status. Which does yours mean?"
msgstr "WooCommerce n’a pas de statut « livrée ». Que signifie le vôtre ?"

#: includes/admin.php:763
msgid "Delivered"
msgstr "Livrée"

#: includes/admin.php:764
msgid "Shipped"
msgstr "Expédiée"

#: includes/admin.php:769
msgid "Handing over to your team"
msgstr "Transmettre à votre équipe"

#: includes/admin.php:769
msgid "When a shopper needs a person, the conversation is emailed to you."
msgstr "Quand un client a besoin d’une personne, la conversation vous est envoyée par e-mail."

#: includes/admin.php:770
msgid "Send handoffs to"
msgstr "Envoyer les transferts à"

#: includes/admin.php:770
msgid "Empty uses the site admin address."
msgstr "Vide : l’adresse de l’administrateur du site est utilisée."

#. translators: %s: the shop's timezone, as WordPress has it
#: includes/admin.php:774
msgid "Opening hours"
msgstr "Horaires d’ouverture"

#. translators: %s: the shop's timezone, as WordPress has it
#: includes/admin.php:774
#, php-format
msgid "So shoppers know when a person will reply. Your site timezone is %s."
msgstr "Pour que les clients sachent quand une personne répondra. Le fuseau horaire de votre site est %s."

#. translators: an example of opening hours; translate the day names for your language
#: includes/admin.php:778
msgid "Mon-Fri 09:00-18:00, Sat 10:00-14:00"
msgstr "Lun-Ven 9h-18h, Sam 10h-14h"

#. translators: an example of opening hours in the format the field reads; translate the day names
#: includes/admin.php:787
msgid "These hours could not be read. Write a day or a span of days, then two times, for example: Mon-Fri 09:00-18:00, Sat 10:00-14:00."
msgstr "Ces horaires n’ont pas pu être lus. Indiquez un jour ou une période, puis deux heures, par exemple : Lun-Ven 9h-18h, Sam 10h-14h."

#: includes/admin.php:791
msgid "Usual reply time"
msgstr "Délai de réponse habituel"

#: includes/admin.php:791
msgid "Said to shoppers outside your hours."
msgstr "Indiqué aux clients en dehors de vos horaires."

#: includes/admin.php:792
msgid "within a few hours"
msgstr "sous quelques heures"

#: includes/admin.php:799
msgid "Your shop"
msgstr "Votre boutique"

#: includes/admin.php:800
msgid "Chat on the storefront"
msgstr "Chat sur la boutique"

#: includes/admin.php:800
msgid "Hide it without disconnecting, for example while you set things up."
msgstr "Masquez-le sans déconnecter la boutique, par exemple pendant la configuration."

#: includes/admin.php:801
msgid "Show the chat to shoppers"
msgstr "Afficher le chat aux clients"

#: includes/admin.php:803
msgid "Store name"
msgstr "Nom de la boutique"

#: includes/admin.php:803
msgid "Shown in the chat header and used by the assistant."
msgstr "Affiché en haut du chat et utilisé par l’assistant."

#: includes/admin.php:808
msgid "Who it is"
msgstr "Son identité"

#: includes/admin.php:808
msgid "Name and status line preview as you type. Whatever you call it, it still tells shoppers it is an AI."
msgstr "Le nom et la ligne de statut s’affichent dans l’aperçu pendant la saisie. Quel que soit son nom, il dit toujours aux clients qu’il est une IA."

#: includes/admin.php:809
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nom"

#: includes/admin.php:809
msgid "Shown in the chat and spoken on calls. Empty means no name."
msgstr "Affiché dans le chat et prononcé pendant les appels. Vide : pas de nom."

#: includes/admin.php:812
msgid "Your shop's assistant"
msgstr "L’assistant de votre boutique"

#: includes/admin.php:817
msgid "Status line"
msgstr "Ligne de statut"

#: includes/admin.php:817
msgid "Keep ours and it is translated. Write your own and everyone reads yours."
msgstr "Gardez la nôtre et elle est traduite. Écrivez la vôtre et tout le monde la lit telle quelle."

#: includes/admin.php:820
msgid "AI assistant"
